== Notes ==
* If the first '''Classified Access Codes''' picked up is temporary and expires, the Atlas Cannon will remain on the current stage and can still be interacted with, providing both a ping to the [[Teleporter]], and damage to the [[Teleporter]] boss.
* Contrary to the wording, this item does not have additive stacking to its damage percentage; it won't simply defeat the boss at 4 stacks. Instead, each stack reduces the leftover boss health by 20% with multiplicative stacking. More precisely, the damage formula is: <math>{\color{White}1-(0.6*0.8^{\text{Stack Amount}-1})*Boss Health}</math>

