== Tips ==

* On the final stage, there are Keycards which can be used to open up locked doors. If you pick up a keycard with the Substandard Duplicator, the temporary keycard is not consumed upon use, allowing you to open all doors before the item duration runs out. Note that permanent Keycards are consumed before the temporary one is used.
* The Duplicator also makes additional temporary copies of any temporary items you pick up, making it extremely powerful with Temporary Item Dispensers and [[Drifter]]’s Salvage, doubling the number of stacks of the item you get AND increasing the lifespan of each stack by 10 seconds. It’s even better with Rebuild, the [[Ancient Scepter]] upgraded version of Drifter’s Recycle, taking the number of temporary copies you get from  recycling from 1 to 3.

