The Artifact of Enigma can found on [[Sunken Tombs]] #1, #2 and #3 in the bottom right of the map where there will be a drop-down to a cove. You must then move right and eventually be boosted up by a hidden geyser, taking you to a tunnel where the artifact lies at the end of.

